        "fun": "A punk-rock lizard that claws at the organs on its chest like guitar strings, crackling with more than 15,000 volts and a sound like an electric guitar or, for Low Key Form, a bass. Amped Form has six chest organs and Low Key four, as many as the strings on each instrument. Yusuke Kozaki designed it and Toxel.",
